      <h1>Who we are</h1>
      <p>I am the owner, military veteran, and craftsman of a business doing what I love, creating handcrafted wooden American flag wall art and other décor pieces just as you want them designed. All flags are unique; each is handmade, and no flag is the same.</p>
      <p>We are dedicated to making burned, charred, rustic, and wooden American flags. These flags are made for wall art, decor, or gifting to your favorite veteran, first responder, or friend. Your piece(s) will be made based on your custom design, or feel free to choose from our standard designs, as they are all unique in their own way. No job is too big or small, as each is made to order, making all flags unique.</p>
      <p>It is an honor to be able to create a flag that you will display in your home or office for years to come. I am grateful each time someone provides me that honor, and I do not take this job lightly.</p>
      <p class="signature">Sheldon L. Jackson</p>
    </div>
